[gd_scene format=3]

; Host writes that go through a ported setter: `pnpm ref:diff --mode in-game` sets one property of
; Peg with `--set` on both sides. Peg sits under Tilted, which is rotated and scaled unevenly, so a
; global setter reads back through a parent that is no rotation alone.

